Instead of the traditional "Multiverse" theory where every decision spawns an entirely new physical universe, an engineer views this through the lens of Phase Modulation, similar to Quadrature Amplitude Modulation (QAM) in telecommunications. There are no new physical universes being created. Instead, different outcomes, possibilities, or choices fall into different phase angles or "Quadrants" on a Constellation Diagram. They all exist within the exact same frequency space. The physical reality we observe and experience is simply the specific quadrant where the cosmic signal currently locks its phase.
